cutive restart failures is an intentional stuck-loop safety path, not the normal Telegram interruption behavior described here.\n", "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4950974353/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}]